  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Catalyze Malawi: Sustainable Green Transition, Entrepreneurship Growth, and Alternative Finance Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Malawi faces significant structural and economic challenges, rooted in its reliance on an undiversified, agro-based economy that accounts for approximately 30% of GDP and 80% of export earnings. This over-reliance exposes the country to vulnerabilities such as climate shocks, environmental degradation, and macroeconomic instability. Key barriers include limited investment in transformative sectors like trade, energy, and digital technology, compounded by logistical challenges due to its landlock</narrative>
  </description>
